# ============================================================
#  RoboMaster OmniInfantry  —  Git ignore rules
#  Keil MDK-ARM / STM32CubeMX 工程
# ============================================================

# ---- Keil 编译产物 / build output ------------------------------
# MDK 输出目录（.o .crf .d .axf .hex .map ...）
**/MDK-ARM/HAL_Template/
**/MDK-ARM/*/*.o
*.o
*.d
*.crf
*.axf
*.htm
*.lnp
*.sct
*.map
*.dep
*.lst
*.bak
*.Bak
*.iex
*.scvd.bak

# ---- Keil 用户个人配置 / per-user IDE state --------------------
# 每个人的窗口布局，提交会一直冲突
*.uvguix.*
JLinkSettings.ini
JLinkLog.txt
*.uvoptx.bak

# ---- 调试 / debug ---------------------------------------------
**/DebugConfig/*.dbgconf.bak

# ---- 系统 / OS ------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ---- 编辑器 / editors -----------------------------------------
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ---- 压缩包与临时文件 / archives & scratch ---------------------
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.tmp

# ---- Keil Assistant / VSCode 插件生成的日志 -------------------
**/.vscode/uv4.log
**/.vscode/uv4.log.lock
**/.vscode/keil-assistant.log
# Keil Assistant 自动生成，含各人本机的 Keil 安装路径
**/MDK-ARM/.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
